                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg496">p. 496</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d197-f2" n="83" xml:id="d197-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 41, April 11, from Rome to Moscow, repeated to the Department of State
                    as 789, not printed, reported that Foreign Minister Sforza was most grateful for
                    the information contained in this telegram (740.0011 EW (Peace)/4–1147).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
